---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import RazorpayDonate from '../../components/RazorpayDonate.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Health Education — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="Health education for women in rural districts: disease awareness, free health check-up camps and prevention education."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Health Education</h1>
        <p>Awareness, prevention and free health check-up camps for women and communities.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <img class="page-image" src="/images/health-education.webp" alt="GWE NGO India — health education session" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          Health Education is very important in small districts especially where the chance of
          spreading diseases is even more and due to lack of resources they are not even able to
          take proper treatment if they acquire a disease. Therefore, GWE NGO India provides health
          education to women which is then passed on by them to other individuals in the district.
        </p>
        <p>
          We also conduct camps providing free health check-ups for individuals making them aware of
          the diseases, their cause and ill-effects and at the same time also telling them how to
          prevent them.
        </p>
        <RazorpayDonate />
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
